{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "2c48bed0-a4dd-8c8f-8e1e-28748074c199",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T14:47:02-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Daniela Quintero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:41:35-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:41:39-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Daniela Quintero. I am calling to report a problem with a crosswalk, and I would kindly like to know to whom it should be directed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place, I can take that. Where's the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:42:01-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 125 Ocean Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. The crosswalk is directly in front of the house, more or less."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:42:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 125 Ocean Avenue. And what's going on with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:42:19-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The paint has faded a great deal. In places it is nearly gone. As a result, the cars do not stop for people who are trying to cross. They simply continue on as though nobody were there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:42:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll do it. Once the lines wear down drivers stop seeing it. Is this something that's been building up, or did it get worse recently?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:42:50-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It has been fading for some time. However, after the coastal storm from Friday into Saturday, three days ago, there is sand and grit across the road, and it seems to me to have made the markings even harder to see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:43:10-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that makes sense, you get a lot of that out on Ocean Ave after a blow. Let me write this down. Faded crosswalk, 125 Ocean Avenue, cars not yielding, sand after the storm. Did I get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:43:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You did, thank you. I should also mention that I have photographs of it. I took several this morning. I can send them, if that would be of use."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:43:44-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help, actually. I'll note that photos are available, and I can give you an email for the department to send them to, or someone can reach out to you for them. Which would you rather?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:44:02-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would prefer that someone reach out to me. I am not very proficient with the email. Kindly use the telephone number I am calling from, or I can give you the number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead and give it, just so I have it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:44:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-five. Got it. And that's Daniela Quintero, Q-U-I-N-T-E-R-O?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:44:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. Q-U-I-N-T-E-R-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:44:36-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'll put it in as a road marking request and flag the photos so whoever picks it up knows to call you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:44:48-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. May I ask, how long do repairs of this kind usually take? I only wish to have some idea of what to expect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:45:01-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it varies. Repainting is weather-dependent, so in the middle of January it's not going to happen right away, they usually wait for a stretch of dry, warmer days. And after a storm the crews have a backlog. So it could be a few weeks, could be longer. Someone will look at it first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:45:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. That is understandable. Is there anything I ought to do in the meantime?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:45:35-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not really, other than being careful crossing. If it ever turns into an emergency, like someone gets hit or almost does, call the police line right away. Otherwise we've got it logged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:45:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I will keep that in mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:45:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else you wanted to report while I've got you? Potholes, anything from the storm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:46:05-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I believe that is all. I am sorry, I was in the middle of deciding what to cook for dinner, and I have no ideas whatsoever. I do not suppose you have a suggestion."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:46:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Soup's always a safe bet this time of year. Beyond that I'm no help, I'm still figuring out my own."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:46:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Soup is a reasonable thought. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:46:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. So I've got the request in for 125 Ocean Avenue, crosswalk markings faded, photos available, callback at the number you gave. Someone from the department should be in touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:46:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much for your help, Mr. Sousa. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T14:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Quintero. Take care."
    }
  ],
